BT /F1 9.5 Tf 12 TL 40 800 Td (Announcements A3 - Big Data Processing) Tj T* () Tj T* (=== A3 Group Formation Reminder: A3 groups will be locked at 11:59 PM on 22 October.) Tj T* (\(2026-10-20\) ===) Tj T* (Hi all,) Tj T* () Tj T* (Please make sure you have joined the correct pre-created A3 group before the deadline.) Tj T* () Tj T* (Please do not use your A1 or A2 group for this assessment. You may keep the same team members,) Tj T* (but you must join an A3 group. Students who choose to complete the assessment collaboratively) Tj T* (but fail to correctly form their group before the submission deadline will receive a 10%) Tj T* (penalty \(2.5 marks\).) Tj T* () Tj T* (If you are completing A3 individually, you do not need to join a group. Groups are intended for) Tj T* (collaborative work only. Students who complete and submit the assessment individually but join) Tj T* (a group will also receive a 10% penalty \(2.5 marks\).) Tj T* () Tj T* (Please check your group membership carefully before 11:59 PM on 22 October. After the groups) Tj T* (are locked, changes to group membership will no longer be permitted.) Tj T* () Tj T* (Regards,) Tj T* () Tj T* (COSC2633/2637 Teaching Team) Tj T* () Tj T* (=== Final reminder: Assessment Extension Applications for A3 \(2026-10-19\) ===) Tj T* (Dear Students,) Tj T* () Tj T* (This is the final reminder that Assignment 3 \(A3\) is due on 25 October.) Tj T* () Tj T* (Under the University's one working day extension policy, extension requests must be submitted) Tj T* (with sufficient time for staff to review and process them before the assessment due date. The) Tj T* (policy still applies regardless of when a request is submitted, and staff are not expected to) Tj T* (accept or review requests received outside of the required timeframe.) Tj T* () Tj T* (As a result, extension applications submitted after 22 October will be denied, as there will) Tj T* (not be sufficient time to grant and process a one working day extension before the A3 due date.) Tj T* () Tj T* (Weeks 11-13 are generally the busiest period of the semester for all students, with multiple) Tj T* (assessment deadlines and other academic commitments occurring during this time. Assessment) Tj T* (deadlines are set in advance, and students are expected to plan their workload accordingly. ) Tj T* () Tj T* (According to the assignment specification, academic workload and time management, including) Tj T* (multiple assignments due in the same week, general study pressure or heavy workload, poor time) Tj T* (management or starting late, and underestimating the difficulty of the assignment, are not) Tj T* (grounds for an extension.) Tj T* () Tj T* (If you believe you are eligible for an extension, please ensure that your application and any) Tj T* (supporting documentation are submitted no later than 22 October.) Tj T* () Tj T* (Please do not wait until the last minute to submit your request.) Tj T* () Tj T* (Thank you for your understanding.) Tj T* () Tj T* (COSC2633/2637 Teaching Team) Tj T* () Tj T* (=== A3 Group Reminder for ***Students Working in Pairs***  \(2026-10-16\) ===) Tj T* (Hi all,) Tj T* () Tj T* (If you are working in a pair \(a group of 2\) for A3 and you do not want another student to join) Tj T* (your group without your permission, please let me know \(ying.zhang3@rmit.edu.au\).) Tj T* () Tj T* (I can lock the group for you so that no additional students can join.) Tj T* ET
endstream
