our group members.) Tj T* () Tj T* (- Do not use your A1 or A2 group for this assessment. You may keep the same team members, but) Tj T* (you must join an A3 group.) Tj T* () Tj T* (Please note that:) Tj T* () Tj T* (- You are not permitted to create new groups or rename existing groups. Student-created groups) Tj T* (are not linked to the grading system and therefore cannot be correctly identified during) Tj T* (marking.) Tj T* () Tj T* (- Canvas groups are intended only for students completing the assessment in groups of two or) Tj T* (three. If you are completing A3 individually, you do not need to join a Canvas group.) Tj T* () Tj T* (Please make sure your A3 group is set up correctly before 11:59pm 22/10.) Tj T* () Tj T* (We will walk through the A3 specification in the Week 11 tutorial class if time allows.) Tj T* () Tj T* (Regards,COSC2633/2637 Teaching Team) Tj T* ET
